So positive yaw rotates +Z toward +X. Starting facing +Z (φ=0 in my parameterization, where f=(cosφ, sinφ) → f=(1,0)?? Wait, +Z is (x=0, z=1). Let me parameterize f = (sinφ, cosφ) so that φ=0 → +Z, and positive φ rotates +Z → +X (f=(sinφ, cosφ): φ=90° → (1, 0) = +X ✓).

